    "updated_at": "2022-06-17T20:08:53Z",
    "body": "Both the drawing delay and disabling git status suck and aren't proper solutions. The issue is that basically my home is a giant Git repo. I don't know what `powerline10k` do differently but I didn't have these issues with it.\r\n\r\nMy workaround is to disable warnings by exporting the flag `STARSHIP_LOG=error`.\r\n",
